WEBVTT

00:00.013 --> 00:29.979
The Platform of Life

00:00.540 --> 00:02.447
A beautiful woman and her rollercoaster life.

00:02.567 --> 00:04.667
The story of an angelic miracle of happiness

00:04.687 --> 00:07.020
starts on a train station platform.

00:08.313 --> 00:09.300
I'll borrow this desk.

00:09.602 --> 00:11.474
The ambulance will be here in five minutes!

00:11.622 --> 00:13.613
The patient will be dead by then!

00:13.858 --> 00:16.031
I didn't have money that night,

00:16.185 --> 00:17.765
but now I can pay however much you ask.

00:18.058 --> 00:21.886
I'd reject every payment from you,
even one as small as a bowl of ramen.

00:22.046 --> 00:26.086
That girl didn't look happy.

00:26.486 --> 00:29.719
Black Jack, Today's Karte - The Platform of Life.

00:30.035 --> 00:36.658
I'm going to fly to where you are.

00:30.035 --> 00:36.658
kimi no moto e tonde yuku yo

00:36.993 --> 00:43.999
I know I can spread my wings when I want to see you.

00:36.993 --> 00:43.999
aitai toki tsubasa hiraku

00:44.584 --> 00:47.669
Nobody knows

00:44.584 --> 00:47.669
dara nimo wakaranai

00:48.088 --> 00:51.507
when a miracle might occur,

00:48.088 --> 00:51.507
kiseki wa itsu okiru?

00:51.508 --> 00:57.930
but it feels like my wish is finally coming true.

00:51.508 --> 00:57.930
nozomi wa kanaeraresou de

00:57.931 --> 01:04.728
Because there's only one place I want to go,

00:57.931 --> 01:04.728
mukau basho wa hitotsu shika nai kara

01:04.729 --> 01:07.981
iro asenai omoi yosete

01:04.729 --> 01:07.981
I gather my feelings whose colors never fade,

01:07.982 --> 01:11.527
and now it seems I'm dreaming.

01:07.982 --> 01:11.527
saa Dreaming now

01:12.112 --> 01:15.447
I'm living for your sake?

01:12.112 --> 01:15.447
kimi no tame ni iketeru

01:15.448 --> 01:18.617
I will be your strength,

01:15.448 --> 01:18.617
donna chikara nimo naru

01:18.910 --> 01:21.829
no matter how far apart we are.

01:18.910 --> 01:21.829
Far away Far away harukana

01:21.830 --> 01:25.624
So Freedom. So Freedom.

01:25.750 --> 01:29.211
I will send you

01:25.750 --> 01:29.211
kimi no tame no okurou

01:29.212 --> 01:32.464
the beautiful blossom of this flower.

01:29.212 --> 01:32.464
kirei ni saita hana wo

01:32.632 --> 01:35.551
So let's look for shooting stars.

01:32.632 --> 01:35.551
Shooting Star Shooting Star sagasou

01:35.552 --> 01:39.555
So Freedom. So Freedom.

02:05.830 --> 02:08.830
The Platform of Life

02:05.850 --> 02:08.830
Originally "A Woman's Case" by Tezuka Osamu

02:13.227 --> 02:15.061
Doc! Hurry, hurry!

02:22.236 --> 02:24.155
Faster!

02:28.910 --> 02:31.351
Ohmigewdness!

02:37.680 --> 02:38.187
Sheesh!

02:38.406 --> 02:41.713
We missed it because you were walking too slowly!

02:41.766 --> 02:44.046
What do we do now, when it's so late?

02:44.286 --> 02:47.043
We're in a tough financial situation again this month!

02:47.345 --> 02:49.596
Excuse me, when's the next train?

02:49.875 --> 02:50.430
That was—

02:50.431 --> 02:51.758
The last one!

02:52.058 --> 02:56.216
If you're trying to make a move on
him, I'll fend you off as his wife!

02:56.562 --> 02:58.313
So the last one is gone.

02:58.374 --> 02:59.664
Yes, it is.

02:59.814 --> 03:01.274
Let's go, Doc.

03:12.056 --> 03:13.242
Her heartbeat is weak.

03:13.537 --> 03:14.871
Pupillary reflex is slow too.

03:15.248 --> 03:16.839
I'll carry her to the train station office.

03:17.166 --> 03:18.527
Have them call for an ambulance.

03:19.460 --> 03:21.184
Tell them that there's a woman in a coma.

03:21.696 --> 03:23.129
Aye-aye!

03:26.634 --> 03:29.052
This is Ginnokuni Station.

03:29.053 --> 03:30.464
Please send an ambulance right away!

03:37.478 --> 03:38.979
I'll borrow this desk.

03:48.281 --> 03:49.656
What's her current condition?

03:50.199 --> 03:52.575
He's asking for details on her condition.

03:54.202 --> 03:58.158
Advanced case of jaundice and a swollen abdomen.

03:58.833 --> 04:02.055
Inferring from the amount of blood she's coughed up,
it must be gastrointestinal bleeding.

04:02.758 --> 04:04.153
She must have an advanced case of hepatocirrhosis.

04:04.505 --> 04:06.423
She's currently in a hepatic coma.

04:06.724 --> 04:09.801
She needs an endoscopy right now,
but there're no tools for that here.

04:09.802 --> 04:10.733
Therefore...

04:11.387 --> 04:12.470
I'll perform a laparotomy.

04:14.140 --> 04:15.348
A laparotomy?!

04:15.349 --> 04:17.684
You mean you're commencing an operation at the station?!

04:17.950 --> 04:19.311
Who are you?!

04:19.312 --> 04:20.353
We'll arrive in five minutes!

04:20.354 --> 04:21.509
Don't do anything!

04:22.606 --> 04:23.970
We can't wait five whole minutes.

04:26.402 --> 04:27.444
It's an emergency operation.

04:27.445 --> 04:29.779
Pinoco, check the blood types of the station staff.

04:30.239 --> 04:31.489
Please don't!

04:31.490 --> 04:33.241
The ambulance will be here in five minutes!

04:33.651 --> 04:35.785
The patient will be dead by then!

04:35.786 --> 04:36.703
Is that what you want?!

04:37.079 --> 04:38.538
Absolutely not!

04:39.498 --> 04:40.999
What's your blood type?

04:41.751 --> 04:42.917
A-positive.

04:42.918 --> 04:44.044
Are you sure?

04:44.195 --> 04:46.546
I've been having my annual check ups.

04:46.547 --> 04:48.225
Good, you're a match.

05:03.522 --> 05:05.476
Hello! Hello!

05:05.908 --> 05:06.835
Hello!

05:06.859 --> 05:07.901
Hey, are you listening!

05:08.981 --> 05:09.903
What's the matter?

05:10.071 --> 05:11.696
I don't know who it was,

05:11.697 --> 05:14.032
but he said he"ll do an emergency operation at the station.

05:14.033 --> 05:15.540
He's got to be kidding.

05:15.951 --> 05:17.202
Hey! Drive faster!

05:20.748 --> 05:21.748
Under construction?!

05:28.130 --> 05:29.547
We're stuck?

05:30.674 --> 05:31.595
Dang it!

05:38.724 --> 05:39.978
I'm short on blood.

05:40.226 --> 05:42.394
Go find all staff members with blood type A-positive.

05:42.395 --> 05:43.895
Y-Yes!

05:48.836 --> 05:51.277
Why did she let it go this long?

06:00.418 --> 06:01.439
Doc, this girl's crying.

06:01.659 --> 06:03.706
Doc, this girl's crying.

06:06.420 --> 06:08.520
Her pulse is getting weaker.

06:09.380 --> 06:11.404
<i>I'm going to die.</i>

06:18.722 --> 06:20.896
<i>The town where I grew up...</i>

06:21.434 --> 06:23.148
<i>The apartment where I lived...</i>

06:24.311 --> 06:28.398
<i>I wanted to return there,
to where I shared a dream with Mom.</i>

06:28.399 --> 06:30.910
<i>But now I can't.</i>

06:33.279 --> 06:34.821
<i>When I was a kid,</i>

06:35.906 --> 06:41.211
<i>I envisioned myself looking like those
pretty women in magazines.</i>

06:42.788 --> 06:45.331
<i>I envied them, thinking they looked like princesses.</i>

06:48.167 --> 06:52.088
<i>My childhood dream became a reality before I realized it.</i>

06:54.008 --> 06:56.014
<i>I was very happy,</i>

06:56.469 --> 07:01.556
<i>and I believed that no misfortune or sadness</i>

07:02.016 --> 07:03.808
<i>could come near me.</i>

07:06.681 --> 07:09.898
<i>I was drowning in the world of dreams.</i>

07:11.650 --> 07:14.374
I was so scared that that dream would come to an end.

07:14.945 --> 07:19.115
<i>So I didn't care who I dated,</i>

07:19.116 --> 07:21.618
<i>as long as he could extend that
dream as much as possible.</i>

07:22.620 --> 07:23.870
<i>I was such an idiot.</i>

07:24.705 --> 07:27.457
<i>I didn't know anything back then.</i>

07:32.087 --> 07:35.548
<i>I thought this dream would last forever.</i>

07:35.549 --> 07:38.259
<i>Yes, an endless dream...</i>

07:39.345 --> 07:40.929
<i>Such an idiot...</i>

07:45.970 --> 07:49.145
<i>There's nothing that lasts forever.</i>

07:53.734 --> 07:56.107
He ordered us not to allow you out of the house.

07:56.445 --> 07:57.737
Don't be ridiculous.

07:58.113 --> 08:00.490
I have numerous job offers.

08:00.491 --> 08:03.618
I must meet my agent and wrap up the
talks for the Milano Collection job.

08:05.663 --> 08:09.207
The master's order is to never allow you out.

08:09.208 --> 08:10.336
We're sorry.

08:11.710 --> 08:15.797
<i>I was only one piece in his art collection.</i>

08:16.757 --> 08:21.302
<i>No matter how much he likes that piece,
he will grow tired of it if he looks at it everyday.</i>

08:21.929 --> 08:23.304
<i>It'll look dull.</i>

08:24.056 --> 08:28.226
<i>I'm a part of his collection that will
never be shown to the public.</i>

08:28.894 --> 08:30.853
<i>That was all I was.</i>

08:32.297 --> 08:33.856
<i>I couldn't stand that.</i>

08:38.320 --> 08:41.573
<i>I fled his house and flew back to Japan.</i>

08:43.075 --> 08:46.995
<i>A letter came from him about the
annulment of our marriage,</i>

08:46.996 --> 08:48.663
<i>but I didn't care...</i>

08:50.916 --> 08:54.043
<i>because I could come back to the limelight</i>

08:54.876 --> 08:57.557
<i>where I shine the brightest.</i>

09:11.270 --> 09:13.104
Your liver is in terrible condition.

09:13.522 --> 09:14.694
We need to admit you.

09:14.940 --> 09:16.149
No!

09:16.191 --> 09:17.859
I don't want to be locked up again!

09:18.319 --> 09:21.696
We need to treat you right now,
or your life will be in danger!

09:30.623 --> 09:31.581
Where's the patient?!

09:33.208 --> 09:34.751
It took you twenty minutes.

09:35.044 --> 09:36.628
Didn't you say five minutes?

09:36.750 --> 09:37.157
Well..

09:37.276 --> 09:37.923
Uh...

09:38.756 --> 09:42.116
I was only going to apply first-aid if you arrived on time,

09:42.939 --> 09:45.178
but you didn't, so I performed the whole operation.

09:47.181 --> 09:48.473
The operation is complete.

09:48.474 --> 09:49.641
Take over from here.

09:50.017 --> 09:51.309
In only twenty minutes?!

09:51.349 --> 09:52.162
No way!

09:52.187 --> 09:53.604
Nobody can possibly do that.

09:54.021 --> 09:57.482
The patient would have run out
of stamina if it took any longer.

10:00.611 --> 10:02.528
Doc she's awake.

10:03.238 --> 10:04.219
Are you awake now?

10:05.491 --> 10:08.660
Am I alive?

10:09.412 --> 10:12.497
Yes, even though you were in critical condition.

10:13.082 --> 10:15.349
You are safe now, thanks to an emergency operation.

10:15.959 --> 10:17.960
You need to rest at a hospital now.

10:18.671 --> 10:20.171
You'll get well in no time.

10:20.172 --> 10:24.693
The world's best doctor saved you.

10:25.094 --> 10:26.622
I thought I was dying.

10:26.970 --> 10:29.071
Doctors have told me as much, too.

10:30.099 --> 10:32.016
Your stomach was empty.

10:32.017 --> 10:33.518
How many days has it been since you've eaten?

10:36.480 --> 10:38.940
Were you dreaming while we were operating on you?

10:40.484 --> 10:41.885
You were crying.

10:43.447 --> 10:44.490
I see.

10:46.201 --> 10:49.492
It was about those dreamy days,
and the end of that dream.

10:49.796 --> 10:53.149
You just had a miraculous operation.

10:53.497 --> 10:57.917
You survived only because this man
just happened to be at the station.

10:58.293 --> 11:00.020
Thank you.

11:00.337 --> 11:01.696
How can I thank you?

11:02.704 --> 11:05.937
You cannot pay the fee I'd ask of you,

11:06.135 --> 11:07.385
so don't worry about it.

11:07.761 --> 11:10.027
No. I must pay you.

11:10.637 --> 11:12.525
I'm unlicensed.

11:12.725 --> 11:16.853
The police have their eyes on me
for charging huge sums of money.

11:17.521 --> 11:18.591
Unlicensed?

11:19.565 --> 11:20.675
Are you going to report me?

11:20.941 --> 11:22.147
No!

11:22.985 --> 11:25.903
But I must pay you.

11:26.405 --> 11:30.867
If you insist, then buy me ramen at a nearby shop.

11:31.165 --> 11:32.754
Don't joke with me.

11:32.995 --> 11:36.058
I'm Hanamura Kazue, a supermodel.

11:36.431 --> 11:39.125
You haven't eaten because you're a model?

11:39.126 --> 11:40.877
So you don't get fat?

11:48.594 --> 11:50.359
I was ready to die,

11:50.804 --> 11:55.725
but you gave me a second chance.
You're like an angel, Doctor.

11:55.726 --> 11:58.132
I have a chance to start over again.

11:59.521 --> 12:02.607
No, I just happened to miss the last train of the day.

12:05.110 --> 12:09.071
You were fortunate this time,
but you need to take a better care of yourself.

12:09.338 --> 12:11.949
Yes. I feel like I'm a new person.

12:12.701 --> 12:14.660
I'll never make this mistake again.

12:14.661 --> 12:15.536
Never again.

12:23.879 --> 12:26.422
There are so many castle-like houses here.

12:26.423 --> 12:29.300
It would be so great if we could live in one of them.,

12:34.097 --> 12:38.572
Doc, I want a car without any engine troubles.

12:45.901 --> 12:48.444
That cloud looks like a parfait.

12:51.790 --> 12:52.790
Oh, my!

12:57.621 --> 12:59.497
It's really you!

13:00.040 --> 13:03.099
I thought that girl looked familiar.

13:04.253 --> 13:06.462
You're that pretty girl!

13:07.005 --> 13:08.377
You're having trouble?

13:08.549 --> 13:10.258
Please stop by my place.

13:10.259 --> 13:12.176
I'll have my men repair it.

13:12.719 --> 13:15.763
I appreciate the offer, but...

13:16.139 --> 13:17.431
Please come in!

13:17.432 --> 13:22.520
You saved my life, don't you want to know how I've been?

13:34.157 --> 13:36.367
So extravagant.

13:46.211 --> 13:49.171
I owe you so much, Doctor.

13:50.974 --> 13:55.177
I didn't have any money that night,

13:55.512 --> 13:58.472
but now I can pay however much you ask.

13:59.391 --> 14:01.733
You seem to be doing quite well.

14:03.270 --> 14:08.941
Yes, I met a man at the hospital
where I was taken that night.

14:10.903 --> 14:12.945
Excuse me, may I?

14:13.488 --> 14:15.555
What's your injury from?

14:16.450 --> 14:17.612
It's from a driving accident.

14:18.076 --> 14:22.872
When you get hit at 200 kilometers per hour,
a bone breaks easily, no matter how strong you are.

14:24.041 --> 14:25.333
200 kilometers per hour...

14:25.834 --> 14:27.806
In a circuit while I was in a race.

14:29.212 --> 14:30.838
Are you a racer?

14:31.025 --> 14:32.269
It's just a hobby.

14:33.175 --> 14:36.761
The shareholders will get on my case again and
tell me to stop my dangerous activities.

14:37.763 --> 14:39.722
You must take better care of your life.

14:40.223 --> 14:42.418
Did I offend you?

14:42.726 --> 14:46.145
You said, "I'm rich, so I can do anything I want."

14:46.688 --> 14:48.487
When did I say that?

14:49.900 --> 14:52.109
It was written all over your face.

15:01.662 --> 15:04.664
We can release you now.

15:04.967 --> 15:07.083
Um, I...

15:07.668 --> 15:09.627
I can't pay my bill.

15:11.056 --> 15:12.964
It's already been paid in full.

15:26.895 --> 15:29.313
Did your pay my hospital bill?

15:29.856 --> 15:31.482
Congratulations on your release.

15:31.523 --> 15:33.123
On face: "I'm rich."

15:41.451 --> 15:46.205
I looked you up, since your face looked familiar.

15:47.040 --> 15:50.167
I hope you won't be offended by this,
Miss Hanamura Kazue.

15:50.369 --> 15:54.130
Models are destined to be forgotten in a mere half a year.

16:00.345 --> 16:02.144
I didn't forget.

16:03.765 --> 16:06.475
Thank you so much for the hospital fee.

16:06.476 --> 16:08.019
I will repay it someday.

16:08.854 --> 16:10.396
Would you go out with me?

16:10.397 --> 16:12.189
Let's call it even with that.

16:13.108 --> 16:15.517
You want to buy my life with money?

16:15.819 --> 16:18.128
Sorry, but I'm not for sale.

16:20.365 --> 16:22.658
Yes, I know.

16:23.076 --> 16:25.619
I'm sure you'll never want to sell your life for money,

16:25.786 --> 16:29.306
but I'm different from that European snob.

16:29.880 --> 16:32.048
Let me prove that to you.

16:37.615 --> 16:41.302
So, he's different from your last husband?

16:41.303 --> 16:43.345
He loves me,

16:43.889 --> 16:46.849
not as a decoration, but as a woman.

16:46.850 --> 16:50.811
Being loved is the greatest happiness
that a woman can have, isn't it?

16:51.083 --> 16:52.906
Yes, it is.

16:53.190 --> 16:54.400
It really is.

16:55.005 --> 16:56.901
I'm happy too.

16:56.902 --> 17:00.738
As long as Doc is near me, I'm happy.

17:01.059 --> 17:03.059
A kid can't tell.

17:03.700 --> 17:05.451
I'm not a kid!

17:05.452 --> 17:09.663
I have many moments when I'm sad or having a hard time,

17:09.664 --> 17:11.832
but I'm still happy!

17:12.292 --> 17:17.026
I consider myself happy, so I'm always happy!

17:20.509 --> 17:22.301
Sounds like the repair is done.

17:22.302 --> 17:23.469
Now, excuse me.

17:26.348 --> 17:27.640
Please wait!

17:28.725 --> 17:30.976
Let me pay for the operation.

17:31.645 --> 17:33.660
I can now pay ¥50,000,000,

17:33.897 --> 17:36.023
or even ¥100,000,000.

17:36.441 --> 17:38.012
Tell me how much.

17:39.861 --> 17:44.494
He'd be happy to pay any amount
to the man who saved my life!

17:47.134 --> 17:49.912
But that's your husband's money.

17:50.372 --> 17:56.794
I'd be much happier if you paid me with
a bowl of ramen from your own money.

17:57.337 --> 17:59.380
Please stop joking with me!

17:59.711 --> 18:01.844
Then I'll pay you ¥100,000,000.

18:02.134 --> 18:04.638
I'll write a check for it here.

18:06.086 --> 18:10.182
I'd reject every payment from you,
even one as small as a bowl of ramen.

18:10.684 --> 18:11.517
Now, excuse me.

18:13.351 --> 18:14.449
Doctor!

18:15.897 --> 18:19.066
I was only trying to convey my gratitude!

18:28.410 --> 18:32.371
Is she not happy, even though
she lives in such a nice house?

18:32.837 --> 18:36.834
That girl didn't look happy.

18:42.340 --> 18:45.092
Wait, Largo! Stay still!

18:45.239 --> 18:46.719
Don't run away!

18:46.862 --> 18:48.929
You need to get cleaned!

18:48.533 --> 18:56.686
Mr. Tokoma Shirow of France corporation, a young
entrepreneur, has been confirmed dead.

18:50.265 --> 18:54.440
Sheesh, you can make people sick too.

18:57.981 --> 19:00.024
It's that lady's house!

19:00.025 --> 19:02.860
Mr. Tokoma's private plane has crashed.

19:03.528 --> 19:05.859
Mr. Tokoma was flying it himself.

19:29.888 --> 19:32.765
Um, I've seen you sitting here every night recently...

19:33.725 --> 19:36.393
Ah, you really are the girl from that night!

19:36.394 --> 19:40.940
I thought you looked like her,
and I wondered if I should talk to you or not.

19:40.941 --> 19:42.691
It's so good to see you doing well!

19:43.051 --> 19:47.446
I've always been concerned with how
you've been after that night.

19:48.760 --> 19:53.075
Your life was saved so miraculously,

19:53.411 --> 19:55.162
so I wanted you to take good care of it.

19:56.081 --> 19:56.872
Um...

19:56.873 --> 19:57.626
Yes?

19:58.583 --> 20:02.086
Does that doctor use this station often?

20:08.969 --> 20:12.846
The last train of the day is about to depart.

20:12.847 --> 20:15.641
Anyone planning to catch this train is advised to hurry.

20:19.229 --> 20:21.272
Doctor! Please wait!

20:29.823 --> 20:31.553
Do you want something from me?

20:32.242 --> 20:36.210
I'm penniless once again.

20:36.705 --> 20:39.173
After his passing, a large debt was uncovered.

20:39.416 --> 20:42.209
His estate was taken away,
and his company went bankrupt.

20:42.877 --> 20:47.172
I only wanted to pursue my dream,
so why do I keep suffering like this?

20:47.632 --> 20:49.739
I thought that way and hated my fate.

20:50.093 --> 20:53.336
I even thought I would've been better off dying that night.

20:55.181 --> 20:59.143
That night, I said you were an angel.

20:59.644 --> 21:02.521
That you gave me another chance.

21:02.702 --> 21:05.941
It wasn't a chance to drown myself in a dream.

21:05.942 --> 21:07.943
I finally realized that.

21:08.528 --> 21:12.906
You gave me another chance to live, right?

21:13.366 --> 21:15.495
A chance to start over.

21:16.911 --> 21:20.347
I already told you that I simply missed
the last train of the day.

21:21.015 --> 21:22.541
I was an idiot.

21:22.542 --> 21:25.836
Happiness is not like ready-made clothing.

21:26.838 --> 21:32.482
It's a tailor-made dress to be designed
and built on your own.

21:43.897 --> 21:46.899
I now work for a dressmaker.

21:47.525 --> 21:49.318
I don't have any money to spare,

21:49.319 --> 21:52.654
but I really wanted to buy you ramen.

21:54.824 --> 21:58.243
This is the best payment I can make right now.

22:03.500 --> 22:04.500
I'll accept this.

22:08.213 --> 22:10.339
Let's go eat it together.

22:11.383 --> 22:13.300
Is there a good place around here?

22:13.301 --> 22:16.261
Yes, there's a cheap yet delicious place.

22:16.262 --> 22:18.430
I want curry ramen!

22:24.104 --> 22:29.216
As you look at the ground uncertainly,

22:24.104 --> 22:29.216
tamerai gachi no fuseta hitomi

22:29.217 --> 22:34.513
I gently pull your hair closer to me.

22:29.217 --> 22:34.513
kono te ga sono kami hikiyoseteta

22:35.144 --> 22:41.645
You didn't speak, but only sighed,

22:35.144 --> 22:41.645
nani mo iezu ni kobore ochita tameiki

22:41.646 --> 22:46.108
and wet my chest with your tears.

22:41.646 --> 22:46.108
namida ga mune wo nurashita

22:46.109 --> 22:51.363
You longed to hear it, even if it was a lie.

22:46.109 --> 22:51.363
use demo ii... to kitto nozonde ita

22:51.364 --> 22:56.118
But I couldn't give you the answer you wanted.

22:51.364 --> 22:56.118
kimi no kimochi ni kotae kirezu

22:56.119 --> 23:04.543
If I gave you that answer, despite my cowardice,

22:56.119 --> 23:04.543
okubyou na boku ga moshi sono toki kotaetetara mada

23:04.544 --> 23:08.130
would we still be together?

23:04.544 --> 23:08.130
tsuzuiteita noka?

23:08.131 --> 23:13.427
That irregular breath my body was accustomed to,

23:08.131 --> 23:13.427
karada ga oboeta fukisoku na breath

23:13.431 --> 23:18.891
I want to feel it one more time.

23:13.431 --> 23:18.891
mou ichido subete de kanjitai

23:18.825 --> 23:24.329
subete wo nakushita fuyoui na breath

23:18.892 --> 23:24.396
The breath of surprise when I lost everything.

23:24.330 --> 23:33.505
And the pain that binds me every time I feel regret.

23:24.330 --> 23:33.505
kuyamu tabi mata sono itami ga shimetsukeru

23:45.052 --> 24:15.018
The Donor of the Skin Transplant

23:45.532 --> 23:47.165
This is a story of Black Jack's beginning.

23:47.545 --> 23:52.132
There is a priceless story of friendship
under Doc's facial skin.

23:52.298 --> 23:52.752
Huh?

23:53.739 --> 23:55.466
You better stay out of this area.

23:55.732 --> 23:57.672
Especially outsiders like you Kuro-chan.

23:57.771 --> 24:00.266
It there any child who's willing
to donate skin for Kuroo-kun?

24:00.579 --> 24:01.939
You can use mine.

24:01.992 --> 24:04.292
Kuro-chan, I'll become a doctor.

24:04.740 --> 24:07.777
Nature and the environment are being
destroyed because of people's egoism.

24:08.213 --> 24:11.221
We need doctors who can
restore nature on Earth!

24:11.312 --> 24:14.878
Black Jack, Next Karte - The Donor of the Skin Transplant.

24:16.124 --> 24:17.785
Karte NG...

24:23.647 --> 24:24.460
Somebody!

24:24.554 --> 24:25.554
Help!
